Modifications made in this fork:

- Removed features that require network access: self-update, update
  channels and background version checks, product announcements, remote
  attach and saved machines over SSH, the online agent-detection manifest
  catalog, and GitHub plugin installation and update.
- Renamed the product, binary, process, and configuration, state, log and
  socket paths from herdr to sy-term. Environment variables, protocol
  identifiers, hook source labels and the plugin manifest format keep their
  original herdr names for compatibility.

This product includes third-party components distributed with herdr,
including the vendored libghostty-vt and portable-pty sources under vendor/,
each under its own license.
